# Rayquaza comes down over Sootopolis (Emerald's MUS_RAYQUAZA_APPEARS role): a sky opening. Over a held low E-flat and a
# shimmer of high strings, the horns call a rising fourth twice, the brass answers with a climbing line, and the whole
# swells to a bright chord in E-flat major as the storm breaks. Plays once, under the scene that calls it; the scene then
# brings back the music of the place. Original composition for this game (plan 21 · H8, part c).
